        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Schlage JD60, Single Cylinder Dexter Grade 3 Deadbolt</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThis single cylinder deadbolt made by Schlage will fit all standard door cutouts. It has an adjustable latch to fit 2-3/8\" or 2-3/4\" backsets; and it will fit door thicknesses ranging from 1-3/8\" up to 1-3/4\". An ANSI Grade 3 deadbolt, it is operated by a key on the outside of the door and by a thumbturn on the inside of the door. Available in an array of finishes with a 5 year finish warranty and a lifetime mechanical warranty.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Single Cylinder Deadbolt:</b> Deadbolt thrown and retracted by a key on the outside or by an inside turn unit. Deadbolt automatically deadlocks when fully thrown.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Features</b> of the Schlage JD60 Single Cylinder Door Locks:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>5 year Finish Warranty.</li>\r\n<li>Lifetime Mechanical Warranty.</li>\r\n<li>ANSI A156.5, 2001, Grade 3 deadbolt.</li>\r\n<li>Comes packaged with two keys</li>\r\n<li>Cylinder: 5-pin, C Keyway</li>\r\n<li>1\" deadbolt with hardened steel core that is resistant to sawing and kick-in attacks.</li>\r\n<li>Free spinning, solid metal cylinder collar resist wrench and hammer attacks as well as prying.</li>\r\n<li>Drill-resistant metal faceplate.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> of the Schlage JD60 Deadbolt:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Material: Zinc-Based plated to matched the finish you choose.</li>\r\n<li>Backset: Adjustable for 2-3/8\" or 2-3/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Door Thickness Range: 1-3/8\" up to 1-3/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Strike Width: 1\"</li>\r\n<li>Strike Height: 2-1/4\"</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<i>Sold Individually</i>\r\n</p>",
            "seo": {
                "title": "Single Cylinder Dexter Deadbolt, Schlage JD60",
                "description": "Schlage JD60 Dexter Single Cylinder Deadbolt JD60 - This single cylinder deadbolt made by Schlage will fit all standard door cutouts. It has an adjustable latch to fit 2-3/8 inch or 2-3/4 inch backsets; and it will fit door thicknesses ranging from 1-3/8 inches up to 1-3/4 inches. An ANSI Grade 3 deadbolt, it is operated by a key on the outside of the door and by a thumbturn on the inside of the door. Available in 8 finishes with a 5 year finish warranty and a lifetime mechanical warranty.",
